    "one_liner": "Based on real usage data from millions of OpenRouter users, this deck reveals the competitive landscape and emerging trends in today's LLM market.",
    "goal": "Help the audience understand which models are most popular in real-world usage, how market share is distributed, which newcomers are rising fast, and what these patterns tell us about industry trends."
